    "explanation": "The final bounded episode had safe, traceable postoperative discharge instructions and caregiver teach-back for red flags, pathology tracking, follow-up, and wound monitoring. The closure was executable for the evolved postoperative state, although the earlier home-medication safety point remained incompletely addressed as a responsibility-chain omission.",
